05:11:40,260 --> 05:11:40,860
Freeze it up, freeze it up.

4125
05:11:40,920 --> 05:11:42,060
Okay, it doesn't work, doesn't work, doesn't work.

4126
05:11:43,240 --> 05:11:44,300
At least I know that now.

4127
05:11:45,260 --> 05:11:45,940
We got to find a friend.

4128
05:11:46,100 --> 05:11:47,240
Oh no, don't step in that.

4129
05:11:51,620 --> 05:11:52,260
Shit.

4130
05:11:58,620 --> 05:12:00,380
How did he hit me?

4131
05:12:00,880 --> 05:12:01,000
Huh?

4132
05:12:02,340 --> 05:12:03,500
Through the snow or what?

4133
05:12:05,760 --> 05:12:06,320
Unreal.

4134
05:12:10,650 --> 05:12:11,950
I don't believe it.

4135
05:12:20,360 --> 05:12:21,080
That was weird.

4136
05:12:28,970 --> 05:12:29,590
Keep moving.

4137
05:12:38,940 --> 05:12:40,700
Oi, surprised me there.

4138
05:12:43,060 --> 05:12:44,860
This is sometimes a horror game.

4139
05:12:54,570 --> 05:12:54,650
Hey.

4140
05:12:58,950 --> 05:12:59,430
Sweet.

4141
05:13:04,320 --> 05:13:04,560
Brrr.

4142
05:13:17,580 --> 05:13:19,000
Just freeze it all up.

4143
05:13:27,980 --> 05:13:30,700
It does not look like freezing, it really does stop fire.

4144
05:13:31,940 --> 05:13:33,020
Sometimes it does.

4145
05:13:34,140 --> 05:13:35,240
Other times not so much.

4146
05:13:45,490 --> 05:13:46,630
I need a friend, oh bad.

4147
05:13:52,720 --> 05:13:53,160
Come on man.

4148
05:13:56,260 --> 05:13:56,860
Yep, there we go.

4149
05:13:57,500 --> 05:13:57,680
No!

4150
05:13:58,380 --> 05:14:00,000
Don't die now, don't die now.

4151
05:14:00,920 --> 05:14:01,680
Did he die?

4152
05:14:05,300 --> 05:14:07,100
Fuck, he died, didn't he?

4153
05:14:12,320 --> 05:14:12,720
Typical.

4154
05:14:17,160 --> 05:14:18,540
We're almost dead here, by the way.

4155
05:14:25,390 --> 05:14:26,470
Got to go real slow.

4156
05:14:52,940 --> 05:14:54,280
Did I just spread the fire?

4157
05:15:19,980 --> 05:15:21,640
Come on man, show me the friendo.

4158
05:15:23,480 --> 05:15:24,340
I need him.

4159
05:15:27,560 --> 05:15:28,460
I beg you.

4160
05:15:32,020 --> 05:15:34,060
Maybe he's up in the corner again, like last time.

4161
05:15:37,090 --> 05:15:37,410
Hiding.

4162
05:15:37,930 --> 05:15:38,190
No.

4163
05:15:42,580 --> 05:15:44,740
I could just go through the portal I guess.

4164
05:15:46,860 --> 05:15:50,240
Yeah, let's make our way to the portal and see if we can't find a friendo on the way.

4165
05:15:51,100 --> 05:15:51,840
That's the new plan.

4166
05:15:52,700 --> 05:15:53,000
There we go.

4167
05:16:04,760 --> 05:16:06,960
Don't you fucking mess with my friend.

4168
05:16:08,860 --> 05:16:10,220
We're saved, again.

4169
05:16:11,580 --> 05:16:15,180
Like imagine I didn't know about this interaction here.

4170
05:16:16,100 --> 05:16:18,340
I would have been dead, this run was over.

4171
05:16:20,540 --> 05:16:23,740
I'm wondering how many things I still don't know about this game.

4172
05:16:23,920 --> 05:16:27,160
That could have saved my runs that would otherwise have gone bad, you know what I mean?

4173
05:16:29,500 --> 05:16:30,500
I really do wonder.

4174
05:16:38,610 --> 05:16:39,030
Ow, ow, ow.

4175
05:16:43,930 --> 05:16:44,750
Thanks friendo.

4176
05:16:45,190 --> 05:16:45,730
Don't kill my friend.

4177
05:16:50,100 --> 05:16:50,580
Shit!

4178
05:16:51,820 --> 05:16:52,920
I'm sorry friend.

4179
05:16:55,040 --> 05:16:55,980
You're a good friend.

4180
05:16:58,580 --> 05:16:59,540
You really helped.

4181
05:16:59,540 --> 05:17:04,380
But you did your part.

4182
05:17:17,460 --> 05:17:17,940
Another friend.

4183
05:17:18,860 --> 05:17:18,980
What?

4184
05:17:19,160 --> 05:17:19,860
How did he just die?

4185
05:17:20,460 --> 05:17:23,000
Did he die from his friend's corpse falling on him or what?

4186
05:17:24,220 --> 05:17:29,380
His corpse was frozen so maybe it counted as some kind of hard, tough, fake body.

4187
05:17:29,520 --> 05:17:29,860
I don't know.

4188
05:17:32,120 --> 05:17:33,220
It was fun.

4189
05:17:34,500 --> 05:17:36,860
No, the friend died by accident there.

4190
05:17:37,720 --> 05:17:39,560
So many friends are dying here unnecessarily.

4191
05:17:43,030 --> 05:17:44,110
It's a friendsicker.

4192
05:17:50,950 --> 05:17:51,530
Matter eater.

4193
05:17:52,350 --> 05:17:53,110
Oh, look at that wand.

4194
05:17:53,590 --> 05:17:55,210
Oh, shitty mana charge speed, never mind.

4195
05:18:11,580 --> 05:18:13,140
Good thing I just checked this out, huh?

4196
05:18:15,380 --> 05:18:16,600
Oh, I can't get in there.

4197
05:18:17,760 --> 05:18:18,540
Hmm, maybe over here.

4198
05:18:21,360 --> 05:18:21,520
Shit.

4199
05:18:23,040 --> 05:18:24,120
Actually, how do I get in?

4200
05:18:28,910 --> 05:18:29,830
Maybe I can get in there.

4201
05:18:29,890 --> 05:18:30,770
There's a small gap.

4202
05:18:34,360 --> 05:18:35,040
Yeah.

4203
05:18:37,540 --> 05:18:38,080
Amazing.

4204
05:18:46,340 --> 05:18:46,720
Whoa.

4205
05:18:46,960 --> 05:18:47,120
What?

4206
05:18:51,170 --> 05:18:51,970
I don't have any water.

4207
05:18:53,810 --> 05:18:54,530
No water?

4208
05:18:55,090 --> 05:18:55,910
No fucking water!

4209
05:18:56,790 --> 05:18:57,010
Fair amount.

4210
05:18:59,530 --> 05:19:00,250
Freeze me.

4211
05:19:02,450 --> 05:19:02,990
Fuck.

4212
05:19:03,750 --> 05:19:04,290
Gone through the portal.

4213
05:19:04,550 --> 05:19:05,110
Oh my god.

4214
05:19:06,030 --> 05:19:08,110
I hate fire so much.

4215
05:19:08,770 --> 05:19:09,690
I hate it.

4216
05:19:10,430 --> 05:19:11,270
I hate it.

4217
05:19:13,050 --> 05:19:14,290
So fucking much.

4218
05:19:14,430 --> 05:19:15,090
Give me water now.

4219
05:19:15,470 --> 05:19:16,450
Before I forget it.

4220
05:19:17,270 --> 05:19:19,730
I've been on the brink of death so many times in this run.

4221
05:19:21,790 --> 05:19:22,650
It's a miracle.

4222
05:19:22,930 --> 05:19:23,630
I'm still alive.

4223
05:19:25,210 --> 05:19:26,170
It really is.

4224
05:19:27,390 --> 05:19:28,070
Okay, nothing great.

4225
05:19:28,390 --> 05:19:29,150
Actually, that was great.

4226
05:19:29,450 --> 05:19:30,230
I like that last part.

4227
05:19:36,420 --> 05:19:37,280
Thank you.

4228
05:19:39,720 --> 05:19:41,060
Oh, that's what I need.

4229
05:19:44,180 --> 05:19:46,040
That's what I goddamn need.

4230
05:19:46,820 --> 05:19:48,220
I'm so happy.

4231
05:19:49,680 --> 05:19:50,220
So happy.

4232
05:20:02,160 --> 05:20:04,420
Maybe a bit too expensive, actually.

4233
05:20:06,680 --> 05:20:07,000
Mana-wise.

4234
05:20:10,440 --> 05:20:11,300
That's too slow.

4235
05:20:17,820 --> 05:20:18,600
Oh, hold on a second.

4236
05:20:20,000 --> 05:20:20,620
Reduce spread!

4237
05:20:22,600 --> 05:20:24,260
That seems pretty dope.

4238
05:20:30,580 --> 05:20:32,000
There's nothing else that I really want.

4239
05:20:34,400 --> 05:20:36,000
Not even the lightning.

4240
05:20:38,380 --> 05:20:38,520
I know.

4241
05:20:39,240 --> 05:20:39,840
It's almost unbelievable.

4242
05:20:41,580 --> 05:20:42,280
But it's true.

4243
05:20:43,440 --> 05:20:44,580
I don't even want it.

4244
05:20:50,260 --> 05:20:51,500
Give me my old wand back.

4245
05:20:53,140 --> 05:20:54,920
Or maybe I should look for a good wand here, actually.

4246
05:20:55,080 --> 05:20:55,800
What are the stats like?

4247
05:20:57,700 --> 05:20:59,360
Ooh, that's actually not bad.

4248
05:20:59,700 --> 05:21:00,380
There's one right here.

4249
05:21:02,020 --> 05:21:03,260
Wait, let me grab my energy orb.

4250
05:21:11,300 --> 05:21:12,860
That's really not bad.

4251
05:21:13,880 --> 05:21:15,900
It's a great digging wand, I think.

4252
05:21:17,020 --> 05:21:18,820
If we can speed it up just a little bit.

4253
05:21:23,140 --> 05:21:25,200
Recharge is a little bit annoying.

4254
05:21:33,840 --> 05:21:35,100
I guess I'll keep this for now.

4255
05:21:39,480 --> 05:21:42,320
But the other... I think I'll replace this wand then.

4256
05:21:47,690 --> 05:21:48,870
I don't even want these anymore.

4257
05:22:03,050 --> 05:22:03,710
Put that there.

4258
05:22:05,430 --> 05:22:06,350
Could even do that.

4259
05:22:11,030 --> 05:22:11,530
No.

4260
05:22:13,010 --> 05:22:14,950
Nope, I don't like it.

4261
05:22:22,010 --> 05:22:23,890
There's no way to make it faster right now, I don't think.

4262
05:22:24,510 --> 05:22:26,250
Not sacrificing my main wand.

4263
05:22:27,410 --> 05:22:28,230
I'll clean my glasses.

4264
05:22:33,540 --> 05:22:35,900
Okay, let's move on.

4265
05:22:37,600 --> 05:22:39,720
240 HP, that's really good at this point.

4266
05:22:40,380 --> 05:22:41,600
I'm happy about that.

4267
05:22:44,520 --> 05:22:45,960
I found a bunch of hearts.

4268
05:22:47,360 --> 05:22:48,720
This is going pretty swell.

4269
05:22:49,260 --> 05:22:50,580
But we gotta go back up again.

4270
05:22:51,160 --> 05:22:54,520
I do wonder if there's a way to get back up without angering the gods.

4271
05:22:55,320 --> 05:22:59,740
Let's say I find a way to dig somewhere... nowhere near...

4272
05:23:00,900 --> 05:23:01,900
the holy temples.

4273
05:23:02,700 --> 05:23:03,220
The holy mountains.

4274
05:23:04,560 --> 05:23:05,460
That should be... whoop!

4275
05:23:06,100 --> 05:23:06,700
Okay, sir.

4276
05:23:07,480 --> 05:23:08,620
That should be okay, I guess.

4277
05:23:09,880 --> 05:23:11,780
We just need to find a spot for it.

4278
05:23:12,940 --> 05:23:14,080
As long as we don't dig in that stuff...

4279
05:23:15,940 --> 05:23:17,280
then they should be okay, right?

4280
05:23:19,960 --> 05:23:23,300
Because right now I'm not entirely comfortable with killing them.

4281
05:23:35,300 --> 05:23:36,900
I'm getting a lot of gold here.

4282
05:23:51,400 --> 05:23:53,880
This wand is dangerous, because it runs out of mana fast.

4283
05:23:54,640 --> 05:23:56,300
And I need to time it correctly here.

4284
05:23:58,120 --> 05:23:59,060
What's going on there?

4285
05:24:10,780 --> 05:24:11,440
Oh my god.

4286
05:24:12,440 --> 05:24:13,140
Look at that wand.

4287
05:24:14,040 --> 05:24:14,320
No,

4288
05:24:21,910 --> 05:24:22,330
actually.

4289
05:24:22,750 --> 05:24:24,090
I will take the triple.

4290
05:24:27,550 --> 05:24:29,030
Other than that, not so much.

4291
05:24:32,460 --> 05:24:34,480
Like, it's good, but it's not, like, fantastic.

4292
05:24:36,320 --> 05:24:37,080
Also, I'm immune to fire.

4293
05:24:37,180 --> 05:24:37,820
Let's keep that in mind.

4294
05:24:39,540 --> 05:24:41,820
I have some killer perks right now.

4295
05:24:44,950 --> 05:24:46,530
I've been super lucky with the perks.

4296
05:25:00,800 --> 05:25:01,240
Ah, no.

4297
05:25:01,760 --> 05:25:02,460
Don't release that.

4298
05:25:04,100 --> 05:25:05,160
Keep the worms inside.

4299
05:25:08,270 --> 05:25:09,050
Why doesn't that blow up?

4300
05:25:10,510 --> 05:25:10,910
Hello?

4301
05:25:16,410 --> 05:25:17,190
Blow up, please!

4302
05:25:17,290 --> 05:25:18,110
What the hell is going on?

4303
05:25:22,420 --> 05:25:23,500
There we go.

4304
05:25:24,780 --> 05:25:25,720
That was a bit finicky.

4305
05:25:30,340 --> 05:25:31,160
Giant spitter bolt.

4306
05:25:35,140 --> 05:25:35,900
Quantum split.

4307
05:25:37,100 --> 05:25:37,760
I'll take that.

4308
05:25:38,260 --> 05:25:39,100
I'll take a couple of these.

4309
05:25:39,260 --> 05:25:40,160
Oh, whoa, whoa, whoa!

4310
05:25:40,620 --> 05:25:41,540
What the fuck's going on?

4311
05:25:42,760 --> 05:25:43,020
Oh.

4312
05:25:44,840 --> 05:25:46,060
You're the one shooting things.

4313
05:25:58,260 --> 05:26:01,300
That's the danger about tinkering everywhere, because you...

4314
05:26:01,300 --> 05:26:04,080
You're trying to tinker and then you get attacked, because you don't pay attention.

4315
05:26:06,020 --> 05:26:07,860
You get too excited about new spells.

4316
05:26:09,940 --> 05:26:11,140
Speaking of, are you too excited?

4317
05:26:11,780 --> 05:26:13,080
This guy seems very excited.

4318
05:26:14,980 --> 05:26:17,920
Is it me, or is the gold looking different in this run than normal?

4319
05:26:18,880 --> 05:26:20,320
It's like it's less glowy.

4320
05:26:20,580 --> 05:26:20,940
Am I crazy?

4321
05:26:22,320 --> 05:26:23,060
Like, look at the gold.

4322
05:26:23,480 --> 05:26:24,840
It's like weirdly matte.

4323
05:26:26,800 --> 05:26:28,440
And flat looking.

4324
05:26:31,040 --> 05:26:33,420
Also, I'm almost dead, so...

4325
05:26:33,420 --> 05:26:33,660
There's that.

4326
05:26:37,420 --> 05:26:38,560
Wait, I forgot my old wand.

4327
05:26:55,720 --> 05:26:56,620
Now we're talking.

4328
05:27:07,860 --> 05:27:09,480
12 mana, 30 mana.

4329
05:27:10,900 --> 05:27:11,700
Oh, yeah.

4330
05:27:12,980 --> 05:27:14,100
That is much better.

4331
05:27:14,540 --> 05:27:16,820
Now we just need to find some add mana, and I'm golden.

4332
05:27:22,120 --> 05:27:22,760
This is great.

4333
05:27:25,860 --> 05:27:27,140
This is one hell of a burst.

4334
05:27:27,940 --> 05:27:28,960
But it's a short burst.

4335
05:27:34,210 --> 05:27:35,130
Takes a while to recharge.

4336
05:27:36,830 --> 05:27:38,570
That could kill me, actually, if I'm not careful.

4337
05:27:54,970 --> 05:27:56,690
I could try and go for the dragon.

4338
05:27:59,710 --> 05:28:01,690
I'm kind of low on HP here, but...

4339
05:28:02,830 --> 05:28:03,670
and I have no teleport.

4340
05:28:03,890 --> 05:28:04,870
Maybe that's a bad idea, then.

4341
05:28:07,900 --> 05:28:08,680
Probably is.

4342
05:28:09,140 --> 05:28:09,920
Also, that's poison.

4343
05:28:15,500 --> 05:28:16,020
There we go.

4344
05:28:35,140 --> 05:28:36,720
This is a good amount of burst I have here.

4345
05:28:36,820 --> 05:28:37,700
This really is...

4346
05:28:39,080 --> 05:28:40,700
something that can kill the dragon, I think.

4347
05:28:49,210 --> 05:28:49,650
Oh, fuck.

4348
05:28:52,410 --> 05:28:53,410
Did I just kill a friend?

4349
05:28:55,390 --> 05:28:56,210
I may have.

4350
05:29:00,130 --> 05:29:01,750
I'm not gonna risk that.

4351
05:29:03,950 --> 05:29:04,370
Whoa!

4352
05:29:09,270 --> 05:29:10,350
This is a good run so far.

4353
05:29:10,430 --> 05:29:11,070
I have a good amount of money.

4354
05:29:11,650 --> 05:29:12,590
I have a good amount of HP.

4355
05:29:13,590 --> 05:29:14,390
Let's just go through here.

4356
05:29:21,610 --> 05:29:21,750
Yo!

4357
05:29:23,850 --> 05:29:24,270
Ooh!

4358
05:29:29,560 --> 05:29:30,160
All right.

4359
05:29:32,280 --> 05:29:33,060
Oh my god!

4360
05:29:35,080 --> 05:29:35,900
That's amazing.

4361
05:29:37,160 --> 05:29:37,770
Glass cannon in...

4362
05:29:37,770 --> 05:29:39,070
as if.

4363
05:29:43,890 --> 05:29:44,730
We gotta get this.

4364
05:29:46,110 --> 05:29:47,030
Because that means...

4365
05:29:47,870 --> 05:29:49,590
it's Lukey layer time.

4366
05:30:02,080 --> 05:30:02,720
So many goodies.

4367
05:30:09,530 --> 05:30:11,350
Look at all these spells I'm carrying around.

4368
05:30:14,990 --> 05:30:18,290
And Admana would be incredible right now.

4369
05:30:23,710 --> 05:30:24,810
This costs 0 mana.

4370
05:30:26,910 --> 05:30:28,250
It costs 12 mana.

4371
05:30:29,090 --> 05:30:29,870
Minus 0.7.

4372
05:30:30,270 --> 05:30:30,790
You know what?

4373
05:30:38,370 --> 05:30:39,010
Wait a second.

4374
05:30:50,170 --> 05:30:50,990
Where's the blast?

4375
05:30:57,870 --> 05:30:58,690
Still kind of slow.

4376
05:31:02,590 --> 05:31:06,050
I'm trying to see if I can get by without using the quick recharge.

4377
05:31:07,990 --> 05:31:08,630
Probably not.

4378
05:31:18,850 --> 05:31:19,530
And you know what?

4379
05:31:19,530 --> 05:31:21,070
We're gonna put a triple instead, maybe.

4380
05:31:23,370 --> 05:31:24,570
The good thing is...

4381
05:31:24,570 --> 05:31:25,950
Oh, these actually reduce cast delay.

4382
05:31:26,090 --> 05:31:26,330
Never mind.

4383
05:31:26,510 --> 05:31:27,610
I was about to say they increase.

4384
05:31:29,070 --> 05:31:30,130
That's what I would have preferred.

4385
05:31:30,310 --> 05:31:31,770
Just to make it a tiny bit slower.

4386
05:31:38,160 --> 05:31:39,720
Maybe that's simply too much mana.

4387
05:31:42,720 --> 05:31:44,320
I'm gonna do a little less damage here.

4388
05:31:45,420 --> 05:31:45,800
Actually, hold on.

4389
05:31:45,900 --> 05:31:46,900
It's about...

4390
05:31:46,900 --> 05:31:49,000
This is actually the same for less mana.

4391
05:31:49,880 --> 05:31:50,180
Hell yeah.

4392
05:31:53,030 --> 05:31:53,690
Not bad.

4393
05:31:53,890 --> 05:31:54,530
I like this.

4394
05:31:55,030 --> 05:31:55,590
Quite a lot.

4395
05:31:56,810 --> 05:31:57,570
This is a mess.

4396
05:32:01,920 --> 05:32:05,140
Any wands here that are stat-wise really good?

4397
05:32:07,280 --> 05:32:08,100
Not really.

