4678
05:49:18,990 --> 05:49:28,850
If you can't get to the endgame, if you don't have the skills, the consistency to always get to the endgame, then maybe the fire one is not always the best answer as the first perk.

4679
05:49:30,930 --> 05:49:31,370
Exactly.

4680
05:49:31,650 --> 05:49:33,470
