4683
05:49:40,390 --> 05:49:45,570
I will get hit, I will get hurt, but that will heal me up and let me keep going.

4684
05:49:45,890 --> 05:49:47,970
It will give me the shot at getting a good run.

4685
05:49:48,750 --> 05:49:53,850
Because I just don't have the skills and consistency to get to the endgame with very...

4686
05:49:55,050 --> 05:49:57,830
